{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"e429b4bb304ca1afa689e8306968e72dda829e9b3d71bcf91eadebf7ae9d76f0","digest":{"component_or_area":"Rebar Bot identity and signing infrastructure","key_entities":["rebar identity create","/rebar/prod/rebar-bot-signing-key","infra/terraform/ssm.tf","rebar_secret_params","REBAR_BOT_SIGNING_KEY","joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","resolve_current_identity","navapbc/rebar"],"problem_keywords":["bot identity","ed25519 keypair","signing key","bootstrap","secret provisioning","git authorship"],"propositions":["A shared Rebar Bot signing identity with ed25519 keypair must be created and registered as an identity ticket with the public key in the keyring.","The bot identity email (joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com) must resolve via git config user.email to the correct identity ticket using case-insensitive matching.","The private key must be provisioned as an AWS SSM SecureString parameter at /rebar/prod/rebar-bot-signing-key and declared in Terraform's rebar_secret_params for IaC tracking.","The private key must also be provisioned as a GitHub Actions secret REBAR_BOT_SIGNING_KEY on the navapbc/rebar repository.","No secret material (private key) must be committed to the repository; the key must exist only in external secret stores."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785823941112931007,"uuid":"78c94b3b-e994-4313-909f-0a624fdfb2ce"}